{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1最均衡，既保住了暂时离开沉重问题、真实地轻松一会儿又没有解决问题的经历，也写出了对亲近生活的向往和后来的自我怀疑；C3覆盖面广但表达稍抽象，C2则弱化了暂时侧身离场这一关键经历。keep：C1明确写出顺着轻快过了一会儿、不急着追问原因，轻松退去后又想起当初先做能做之事的决定，C3次之，C2没有充分写出暂时从沉重问题中松开的过程。cover：C3以心事纠缠、逼自己定下来解释焦躁和方向不定，又写出暂时歇息、向往亲近以及后来怀疑自己的过程，对B1、B2、B3、B4、B5的原因覆盖最广。lean：C3没有像C1、C2那样在说过眼下做不到之后又补充眼前难处仍在，转折相对集中；C1重复表达了向前与没退、眼下做不到与难处仍在。plain：C1的拿不准该往哪使劲、不必时时防备等表达最像一个人在讲自己的处境，C2稍显概念化，C3的几件事纠缠着比较笼统。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "85f9d0af-6161-4818-8e88-e852b3f5138e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T225743923694Z", "elapsed_seconds": 153.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:00:17.221361+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c3b1027459a54ae8cd7598430a6a52349da69e7de0234b29eb8fe048d4485ab7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b94884